# PORT03 acceptance: drag C:\README.TXT onto C:\QED.NAP inside the C:\ window.
# With the cflib pin moved to ce57817, make_normalpath keeps the trailing
# backslash it appended, QED's unconditional strip in poslist.c:53-54 removes
# exactly that one character again, and the file QED asks for is the whole
# name -- so the window must carry the FULL title C:\README.TXT.
#
# Click points for THIS card (probe run, method/probe.actions, 2026-09-25):
#   C:\ window   README.TXT (347,271)   QED.NAP (179,271)
# Alt+C (scancodes 38 2e ae b8) opens the C:\ window.
# Pointer park is (639,479) -- `parkbr`, which crosses no menu title (A79).
#
# After the file is open, Ctrl+O (1d 18 98 9d) opens QED's "Oeffnen..."
# (qed.rsc: "Oeffnen...  ^O", menu.c:409 MOPEN -> select_multi -> cflib
# select_file): the SECOND cflib path the swap has to survive, and the one
# that calls the rewritten path_exists/file_exists on every listed entry.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 key 38
1550 key 2e
1600 key ae
1650 key b8
2800 mark B_WIN
3100 move 347 271
3700 down
4500 drag 260 271
5100 drag 179 271
5900 up
6500 parkbr
9500 mark C_QED
10500 key 1d
10600 key 18
10700 key 98
10800 key 9d
13500 mark D_FSEL
16000 pause
